SUMMARY:🦌 鹿園高地 Deer Park Heights
LOCATION:Deer Park Heights\, Peninsula Road\, Kelvin Heights\, Queenstown
DESCRIPTION:【NZ 10/3（六）14:00】\n\n皇后鎮 4 天唯一的寬鬆
 時段。市區開過去約 20 分鐘，園內 5km 景觀車道自駕環
 繞，停留 1.5–2 小時很充裕。餵鹿、山羊、驢子、迷你
 馬要帶 NZ$2 硬幣。LOTR《雙塔奇兵》Rohan 拍攝地。⚠️ 
 關園 18:00、禁止步行進入、要先線上訂票。\n\n📍 地圖
 導航：https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Deer%20Park%20H
 eights%2C%20Peninsula%20Road%2C%20Kelvin%20Heights%2C%20Queenstown\n🔗
  官網／訂票：https://booking.deerparkheights.co.nz/
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Deer%20Park%20Heights
 %2C%20Peninsula%20Road%2C%20Kelvin%20Heights%2C%20Queenstown
